ppe_system/
├─ main.py                 # ties everything together (example single stream)
├─ memryx_wrapper.py       # wrapper class to call MemryX Simulator / AsyncAccl
├─ ring_buffer.py          # circular buffer storing recent frames + timestamps
├─ ppe_logic.py            # logic to decide PPE compliance from detections
├─ alerting.py             # sends webhook / email and persists metadata
├─ config.py               # configuration variables
